{"ticker":"HPE","updated":"2026-11-13T23:34:05Z","profile":{"longName":"Hewlett Packard Enterprise Company","shortName":"Hewlett Packard Enterprise Comp","sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","country":"United States","website":"https://www.hpe.com","fullTimeEmployees":67000,"marketCap":64103276544,"trailingPE":24.891752,"forwardPE":10.197768,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5309708,"pegRatio":0.4,"targetMeanPrice":72.2019,"targetHighPrice":92.0,"targetLowPrice":62.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.337,"earningsGrowth":4.102,"grossMargins":0.36622003,"operatingMargins":0.081199996,"profitMargins":0.06666,"totalRevenue":41870999552,"beta":1.466,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":73.56,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":19.84,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.14},"summary":"Hewlett Packard Enterprise Company, together with its subsidiaries, develops intelligent solutions in the United States, the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, Japan, and internationally. It operates in five segments: Server, Hybrid Cloud, Networking, Financial Services, and Corporate Investments and Other. The company offers general-purpose servers, workload-optimized servers, and integrated systems, including HPE ProLiant Rack and Tower servers; HPE Synergy; HPE Scale Up servers; HPE Edgeline servers; HPE Cray EX; HPE Cray XD; and HPE NonStop. It also provides cloud-native and hybrid solutions, such as HPE Alletra Storage; HPE InfoSight; HPE CloudPhysics; and HPE GreenLake. In addition, the company develops and sells networking and security products and services comprising hardware products, which include Wi-Fi and private cellular access points, MX and PTX routers, and gateways, as well as QFX, EX, and CX switches; software products, such as Mist and Aruba Central; and services comprising professional, maintenance, support services, management software, and education and training programs. Further, it offers investment solutions, including leasing, financing, IT consumption, utility programs, and asset management services, as well as supports financial solutions for on-premise flexible consumption models. The company serves commercial and large ente","summary_zh":"惠普企業公司及其子公司在美國、美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區、日本和國際上開發智慧解決方案。它分為五個部門：伺服器、混合雲、網路、金融服務、企業投資及其他。該公司提供通用伺服器、工作負載優化伺服器和整合系統，包括 HPE ProLiant 機架式和塔式伺服器； HPE 協同； HPE Scale Up 伺服器； HPE Edgeline 伺服器； HPE Cray EX；HPE Cray XD；和 HPE NonStop。它還提供雲端原生和混合解決方案，例如 HPE Alletra Storage； HPE InfoSight； HPE 雲端物理；和 HPE GreenLake。此外，該公司還開發和銷售網路和安全產品及服務，包括硬體產品，包括 Wi-Fi 和專用蜂窩接入點、MX 和 PTX 路由器、網關以及 QFX、EX 和 CX 交換機；軟體產品，例如 Mist 和 Aruba Central；和服務，包括專業、維護、支援服務、管理軟體以及教育和培訓計劃。此外，它還提供投資解決方案，包括租賃、融資、IT消費、公用事業計劃和資產管理服務，並支援本地靈活消費模式的財務解決方案。本公司服務商業及大型企業","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"通訊設備","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":24.8,"h":25.037,"l":24.505,"c":24.84,"v":18368000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":24.91,"h":24.97,"l":24.34,"c":24.43,"v":21439300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":24.55,"h":24.959,"l":24.25,"c":24.73,"v":25280500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":25.0,"h":25.35,"l":24.89,"c":25.24,"v":22034800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":25.21,"h":25.32,"l":24.86,"c":24.99,"v":32895700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":24.955,"h":25.356,"l":24.9,"c":25.16,"v":28153200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":25.12,"h":25.315,"l":24.68,"c":24.7,"v":25207500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":24.89,"h":25.066,"l":24.37,"c":24.46,"v":25135600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":24.02,"h":24.255,"l":23.87,"c":24.21,"v":32909800},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":24.08,"h":24.15,"l":23.805,"c":24.0,"v":20647700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":24.31,"h":24.685,"l":24.1,"c":24.14,"v":19445300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":24.1,"h":24.565,"l":23.98,"c":24.56,"v":22897400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":24.38,"h":24.975,"l":24.23,"c":24.93,"v":27908400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":25.17,"h":25.31,"l":24.41,"c":24.48,"v":17599900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":24.6,"h":25.0,"l":24.3,"c":24.43,"v":20800300},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":24.97,"h":25.255,"l":24.765,"c":24.79,"v":15656000},{"t":"2025-10-07",